                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A finite pattern that moves like a spaceship but leaves a trail of debris."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "798127b3-de96-42e7-b916-5747ecec0830",
                                                "sense_id": "4201deda-a37d-3fe8-b5fe-5a1300d28385",
                                                "text": "This is the next best thing, which is a pseudo-puffer made by converting a stream of spaceships into puffer output using several c/3 spaceships."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a83cebe6-205d-4325-9b2c-31d97643a4df",
                                                "sense_id": "4201deda-a37d-3fe8-b5fe-5a1300d28385",
                                                "text": "Might be interesting to see if the debris from this puffer can be suppressed somehow -- assuming somebody hasn't already done that, but I don't see any sign of previous attempts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "100576f4-b183-4389-820f-12c1aa5b706d",
                                                "sense_id": "4201deda-a37d-3fe8-b5fe-5a1300d28385",
                                                "text": "The switch engine is unstable but a number of them working in combination can form stable puffers, spaceships and rakes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c004ed3-d3e9-3025-837c-96a35ee1f9e4",
